  "description": "A comprehensive .NET 8 utility library for financial services, mobile money, EMV QR codes, API consumption, serialization, and more. Includes support for 200+ countries with ISO codes, phone validation/formatting, all ISO 4217 currencies, EMVCo-compliant QR code generation for worldwide payment systems, advanced date/time utilities, optimized JSON/XML serialization, REST/SOAP API consumption, validation utilities (IBAN, credit cards, BIC/SWIFT, VAT), cryptography utilities (AES, RSA, hashing, signatures), and file manipulation utilities. Perfect for FinTech, mobile money, banking, and payment applications.",
